## Why This Is Asked
Tests practical debugging of per-tenant feature flags and zero-downtime rollout strategies.

## Key Concepts
- Kubernetes ConfigMaps and pod configuration propagation
- Environment variables vs mounted files for configuration delivery
- Canary deployments and rollback safety mechanisms
- Observability practices and latency budget management

## Code Example
```javascript
// Reads a per-tenant flag from environment variable with fallback to false
function isBetaEnabled(tenantId){
  const cfg = JSON.parse(process.env.TENANT_FLAGS || '{}');
  return !!cfg[tenantId]?.betaRoute;
}
```

